    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "NEW TO THE MARKET\r\n\r\nMOUNT STREET, CLAREMORRIS, CO. MAYO\r\n\r\nLARGE THREE-STOREY MULTI-PURPOSE PREMISES\r\n\r\nFOR SALE\r\n\r\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market this substantial three-storey town centre property located on Mount Street, Claremorris, Co. Mayo.\r\n\r\nThis extensive freehold premises offers enormous potential for a wide variety of uses and represents an excellent opportunity for investors, developers, business owners or those seeking a town centre redevelopment project.\r\n\r\nThe property occupies a prime location within Claremorris Town and is suitable for a range of commercial, residential or mixed-use developments, subject to any necessary planning permissions.\r\n\r\nA major attraction of this property is its eligibility for Government grant assistance, including the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant and energy efficiency upgrade grants, subject to approval and qualifying criteria.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n• Large three-storey freehold premises\r\n• Prime town centre location\r\n• Excellent redevelopment opportunity\r\n• Suitable for commercial, residential or mixed-use purposes\r\n• Eligible for Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant up to €70,000 (subject to approval)\r\n• Eligible for insulation and energy upgrade grants up to €30,000 (subject to approval)\r\n• Strong investment potential\r\n• Walking distance to all town amenities\r\n\r\nLocation Highlights:\r\n\r\n• Situated on Mount Street, Claremorris\r\n• Walking distance to shops, schools, church, restaurants and public services\r\n• Excellent accessibility to the N17 Galway–Sligo route\r\n• Approx. 15 minutes to Ireland West Airport Knock\r\n• Convenient to Castlebar, Ballina, Tuam and Galway City\r\n\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a substantial town centre property with outstanding future potential.\r\n\r\nViewing comes highly recommended and is strictly by appointment with the sole selling agents.\r\n\r\nMartin Finn & Nigel Dineen Auctioneers\r\nMIPAV MMCEPI\r\nPSRA Licence No. 002031\r\n\r\n094 9362216 | 086 2130723\r\n\r\nEverything we touch turns to SOLD\r\n\r\nDisclaimer:\r\nThese particulars are issued for guidance only and do not form part of any contract. Intending purchasers should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all information provided."
      },
